v></div></header><main id=\"main\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/case-studies/logistics-mdr-rollout#article\",\"headline\":\"Onboarding found that 31% of configured log sources had never delivered an event — before a single detection was written.\",\"description\":\"The client had a SIEM, a vendor rule pack, an alert queue nobody read, and a managed service whose contractual commitment was measured on how fast an alert was forwarded. That service level rewards forwarding, so that is what it produced: 60 to 90 notifications a week, each requiring the client’s tw\",\"articleSection\":\"Case study\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-GB\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/case-studies/logistics-mdr-rollout\"},\"about\":{\"@type\":\"Thing\",\"name\":\"Logistics\"},\"keywords\":\"Managed Detection & Response, Cloud Security, Incident Response\",\"isAccessibleForFree\":true,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/#organization\"},\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/#organization\"},\"citation\":[\"31% — of configured log sources were silently not arriving (Found in week 3, before go-live)\",\"4 min — median analyst contact on critical detections (Against a 15-minute contractual commitment)\",\"11 → 3 — escalations per week after tuning (Conclusions, not raw alerts)\"]},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/case-studies/logistics-mdr-rollout#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://envenox.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Case studies\",\"item\":\"https://envenox.com/case-studies\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Onboarding found that 31% of configured log sources had never delivered an event — before a single detection was written.\",\"item\":\"https://envenox.com/case-studies/logistics-mdr-rollout\"}]}]}</script><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" style=\"padding-top:calc(var(--nav-h) + var(--s16))\" aria-labelledby=\"cs-headline\"><div class=\"u-container\"><nav class=\"cs-breadcrumb u-mono\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol><li><a href=\"/\">Envenox</a></li><li><a href=\"/case-studies\">Case studies</a></li><li aria-current=\"page\">Logistics</li></ol></nav><div class=\"cs-meta\"><div class=\"cs-meta__cell\"><span class=\"cs-meta__key u-mono\">Client</span><p class=\"cs-meta__value\">Freight and customs broker, 1,200 employees</p></div><div class=\"cs-meta__cell\"><span class=\"cs-meta__key u-mono\">Industry</span><p class=\"cs-meta__value\">Logistics<!-- --> · <!-- -->Netherlands</p></div><div class=\"cs-meta__cell\"><span class=\"cs-meta__key u-mono\">Services used</span><ul class=\"cs-meta__tags\"><li><a class=\"cs-meta__tag-link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\"><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">MDR</span></a></li><li><a class=\"cs-meta__tag-link\" href=\"/services/cloud-security\"><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Cloud Security</span></a></li><li><a class=\"cs-meta__tag-link\" href=\"/services/incident-response\"><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Incident Response</span></a></li></ul></div><div class=\"cs-meta__cell\"><span class=\"cs-meta__key u-mono\">Engagement</span><p class=\"cs-meta__value\">7 weeks to live, retainer ongoing<!-- --> · <!-- -->Retainer</p></div></div><div class=\"cs-hero\"><div class=\"cs-hero__main\"><div class=\"cs-meta__markers\"><div class=\"cs-meta__nda\"><div class=\"nda\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.3333333333333335\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock nda__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg><div class=\"nda__body\"><span class=\"nda__kicker u-mono\">Named under NDA</span><p class=\"nda__name\">Freight and customs broker, 1,200 employees</p><p class=\"nda__note\">Metrics, technical detail and the attributed quote are published with written client approval. The name is not.</p></div></div></div></div><h1 id=\"cs-headline\" class=\"cs-headline\">Onboarding found that 31% of configured log sources had never delivered an event — before a single detection was written.</h1></div><div class=\"cs-hero__results\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow cs-results__key\">Results</p><ul class=\"mc mc--stack\" aria-label=\"The three measured results, each drawn from its own figures\"><li class=\"mc-row\"><p class=\"mc-value u-tnum\">31%</p><p class=\"mc-label\">of configured log sources were silently not arriving</p><div class=\"mc-art\"><svg class=\"mc-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 56\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"of configured log sources were silently not arriving: 31 per cent of the whole. The track is 100 per cent.\"><rect class=\"mc-track\" x=\"0\" y=\"16\" width=\"300\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect class=\"mc-fill\" x=\"0\" y=\"16\" width=\"93\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line class=\"mc-rule\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"35\"></line><text class=\"mc-axis\" x=\"0\" y=\"47\">0%</text><text class=\"mc-axis\" x=\"300\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"end\">100%</text><text class=\"mc-barText\" x=\"100\" y=\"27\">31%</text></svg></div><p class=\"mc-note u-mono\"><span class=\"mc-noteKey\">Measurement window</span>Found in week 3, before go-live</p></li><li class=\"mc-row\"><p class=\"mc-value u-tnum\">4 min</p><p class=\"mc-label\">median analyst contact on critical detections</p><div class=\"mc-art\"><svg class=\"mc-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 56\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"median analyst contact on critical detections: 4 min against a stated ceiling of 15 min. The full track is the ceiling.\"><rect class=\"mc-track\" x=\"0\" y=\"16\" width=\"300\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect class=\"mc-fill\" x=\"0\" y=\"16\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line class=\"mc-limit\" x1=\"299\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"299\" y2=\"35\"></line><text class=\"mc-barText\" x=\"87\" y=\"27\">4 min</text><text class=\"mc-axis\" x=\"300\" y=\"47\" text-anchor=\"end\">15 min committed</text></svg></div><p class=\"mc-note u-mono\"><span class=\"mc-noteKey\">Measurement window</span>Against a 15-minute contractual commitment</p></li><li class=\"mc-row\"><p class=\"mc-value u-tnum\">11 → 3</p><p class=\"mc-label\">escalations per week after tuning</p><div class=\"mc-art\"><svg class=\"mc-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 56\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"escalations per week after tuning: 11 before, 3 after, 73% lower. Both bars are drawn to one scale.\"><rect class=\"mc-barFrom\" x=\"0\" y=\"6\" width=\"300\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"mc-barText mc-barText--on\" x=\"294\" y=\"17\" text-anchor=\"end\">11</text><rect class=\"mc-barTo\" x=\"0\" y=\"33\" width=\"81.81818181818181\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"mc-barText mc-barText--to\" x=\"88.81818181818181\" y=\"44\">3</text></svg></div><p class=\"mc-note u-mono\"><span class=\"mc-noteKey\">Measurement window</span>Conclusions, not raw alerts</p></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"cs-challenge\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"cs-band\"><div class=\"cs-band__head\"><h2 id=\"cs-challenge\" class=\"cs-band__title\">The challenge</h2></div><div class=\"prose u-measure\"><p>The client had a SIEM, a vendor rule pack, an alert queue nobody read, and a managed service whose contractual commitment was measured on how fast an alert was forwarded. That service level rewards forwarding, so that is what it produced: 60 to 90 notifications a week, each requiring the client’s two-person security team to perform the investigation. The team had rationally stopped reading them. An auditor had asked for detection coverage evidence and the honest answer was that nobody knew.</p></div></div><div class=\"cs-band\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s24)\"><div class=\"cs-band__head\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">In <!-- -->5<!-- --> phases</p><h2 id=\"cs-approach\" class=\"cs-band__title\">The approach</h2></div><ol class=\"reveal-group cs-phases\" aria-labelledby=\"cs-approach\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"cs-phase\"><p class=\"cs-phase__n u-mono u-tnum\">01</p><div><h3 class=\"cs-phase__name\">Architecture before alerts</h3><p class=\"cs-phase__body\">Two weeks on the architecture, the identity model and the crown jewels — the customs declaration system and the payment run. We wrote down what an attack on this specific business would look like before writing a detection.</p></div></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"cs-phase\"><p class=\"cs-phase__n u-mono u-tnum\">02</p><div><h3 class=\"cs-phase__name\">Validate every log source</h3><p class=\"cs-phase__body\">Each configured source was checked for actual delivery, not configured status. Twenty-two of seventy-one had never delivered an event. Four more had stopped in 2024 after a platform upgrade. This is the single most common gap we find and it is invisible until someone looks.</p></div></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"cs-phase\"><p class=\"cs-phase__n u-mono u-tnum\">03</p><div><h3 class=\"cs-phase__name\">Write detections against the real architecture</h3><p class=\"cs-phase__body\">Sigma rules in the client’s own repository, reviewed as code, mapped to ATT&amp;CK. The vendor pack was retired rather than tuned, because a pack with its noisy rules disabled is a pack with its coverage disabled.</p></div></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"cs-phase\"><p class=\"cs-phase__n u-mono u-tnum\">04</p><div><h3 class=\"cs-phase__name\">Agree containment authority while nobody was under pressure</h3><p class=\"cs-phase__body\">Host isolation and session revocation pre-authorised after a confirmed detection; anything touching customs declaration availability requires a phone call. Written down in week six, reviewed quarterly.</p></div></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"cs-phase\"><p class=\"cs-phase__n u-mono u-tnum\">05</p><div><h3 class=\"cs-phase__name\">Validate with real technique execution</h3><p class=\"cs-phase__body\">A purple-team exercise in week eight executed 34 techniques against the live telemetry. Twenty-six produced a detectable signal. The eight that did not were fixed, and the exercise is now quarterly.</p></div></div></li></ol></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-label=\"What Freight and customs broker said\"><div class=\"u-container\"><figure class=\"cs-quote\" style=\"margin:0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.125\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-quote cs-quote__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path></svg><div><blockquote class=\"cs-quote__text\">The thing I had not understood is that we were paying for alert forwarding and calling it detection. Twenty-two log sources had been dead for years and our previous provider’s dashboard showed them green, because it showed configuration, not delivery.</blockquote><figcaption class=\"cs-quote__attr\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder portrait for Information Security Manager\" class=\"avatar-ph\" style=\"width:56px;height:56px;font-size:19px;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(257 18% 22%), hsl(257 22% 14%))\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">IM</span></div><div><p class=\"cs-quote__name\">Information Security Manager</p><p class=\"cs-quote__role\">Information Security Manager<!-- --> · <!-- -->Freight and customs broker</p></div></figcaption></div></figure></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"cs-technical\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"cs-band\"><div class=\"cs-band__head\"><h2 id=\"cs-technical\" class=\"cs-band__title\">The technical layer</h2><p class=\"cs-band__hint\">What we actually found or built.</p></div><div class=\"prose u-measure\"><p>The gap that mattered most was identity, not endpoint. The previous service monitored EDR telemetry and firewall logs and did not ingest the identity provider’s sign-in logs at all, which means a session-token replay from a stolen browser cookie — no password, no MFA prompt, no endpoint agent involvement — produced no signal anywhere in the estate. The purple team demonstrated exactly this: a token exported from a test workstation was replayed from a different country and a different device, accessed the customs declaration system, and generated zero alerts under the old configuration. Impossible-travel and unfamiliar-device detections now cover it, and the client was able to show an auditor the before and after with the technique execution as evidence. A second finding during cloud review: the CI role could assume the production deployment role, which could read the KMS key that decrypts the declaration archive — a three-step path from a repository contributor to the data.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"cs-consoles\"><div class=\"u-container\"><h2 id=\"cs-consoles\" class=\"cs-band__title\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--s4)\">What the work looked like on screen</h2><p class=\"cs-band__hint\" style=\"max-width:68ch;margin-bottom:var(--s16)\">Drawn rather than screenshotted. These stand in for platforms we operate and do not own, so the data on them is illustrative — the density, the columns and the decisions recorded on them are the real ones.</p><div class=\"cs-consoles\"><div class=\"cs-console\"><div class=\"cs-console__say\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">What replaced the forwarded alert</p><h3 class=\"cs-console__title\">A conclusion with the triage attached</h3><p class=\"cs-console__body\">The previous service produced sixty to ninety notifications a week and left the investigation with a two-person team. What arrives now is a worked record: the evidence, the timestamped triage notes and the analyst’s conclusion.</p></div><div class=\"cs-console__art\"><figure data-reveal=\"\" class=\"product_figure__CFsTQ\"><div class=\"product_console__JtIC_\" data-scene=\"3\"><div class=\"product_titlebar__rns9g\"><span class=\"product_titleGroup__MMGDe\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check product_titleIcon__O6a8i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"product_title__jwaL7\">Managed SIEM — Alert queue</span><span class=\"product_tenant__pmMjS\">Northwind Logistics Group<!-- --> · <span class=\"u-mono\">TEN-4471</span></span></span><span class=\"product_titleSpacer__ZMvYH\"></span><span class=\"product_titleMeta__atJAM\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">2026-10-14 12:35–14:31 UTC</span></span></div><div class=\"product_toolbar__r0M90\"><span class=\"product_count__QBcJS\"><span class=\"product_countNum__vy53C u-mono u-tnum\">14</span> of<!-- --> <span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">2,847</span> alerts</span><span class=\"product_search__P2jrL\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg><span class=\"u-mono\">severity:&gt;=medium estate:<!-- -->nwl-prod</span></span><span class=\"product_chipRow__xIuJh\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-funnel product_titleIcon__O6a8i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 20a1 1 0 0 0 .553.895l2 1A1 1 0 0 0 14 21v-7a2 2 0 0 1 .517-1.341L21.74 4.67A1 1 0 0 0 21 3H3a1 1 0 0 0-.742 1.67l7.225 7.989A2 2 0 0 1 10 14z\"></path></svg><span class=\"product_chip__vpL6H product_chipActive__MxUo9\">Open<span class=\"product_chipCount__IT0BR u-mono u-tnum\">9</span></span><span class=\"product_chip__vpL6H \">Critical + High<span class=\"product_chipCount__IT0BR u-mono u-tnum\">6</span></span><span class=\"product_chip__vpL6H \">Assigned to me<span class=\"product_chipCount__IT0BR u-mono u-tnum\">3</span></span><span class=\"product_chip__vpL6H product_chipActive__MxUo9\">Last 2 h<span class=\"product_chipCount__IT0BR u-mono u-tnum\">14</span></span><span class=\"product_chip__vpL6H \">Suppressed<span class=\"product_chipCount__IT0BR u-mono u-tnum\">41</span></span></span></div><div class=\"product_scroller__YfDg4 product_queueScroll__miQim\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Managed SIEM alert queue, scrolls horizontally\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"product_table__XMZjK\" role=\"table\" aria-label=\"Managed SIEM alert queue\"><div class=\"product_head__PTccq\" role=\"row\"><span class=\"product_headCell__m8m1J\" role=\"columnheader\">Severity</span><span class=\"product_headCell__m8m1J\" role=\"columnheader\">Time (UTC)</span><span class=\"product_headCell__m8m1J\" role=\"columnheader\">Asset</span><span class=\"product_headCell__m8m1J\" role=\"columnheader\">Detection</span><span class=\"product_headCell__m8m1J\" role=\"columnheader\">Technique</span><span class=\"product_headCell__m8m1J\" role=\"columnheader\">Assignee</span><span class=\"product_headCell__m8m1J\" role=\"columnheader\">State</span></div><div class=\"product_row__geDuE product_rowHover__qWq3Y product_rowArriving__6dh3M product_step1__qzzJw\" role=\"row\" style=\"--enter-delay:0ms\"><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_railCell__vgygh product_sevHigh__aqAna\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevHigh__aqAna\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Severity<!-- -->: </span>High</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO u-mono u-tnum\" role=\"cell\">14:31:48</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"u-mono\">freight-booking-api-01</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"Refresh token replay rejected post-revocation — same ASN\">Refresh token replay rejected post-revocation — same ASN</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"u-mono\" title=\"Valid Accounts: Cloud Accounts\">T1078.004</span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\"> — <!-- -->Valid Accounts: Cloud Accounts</span></span><span class=\"pr