cessful MFA sign-in from the London office range, then enumerated 1,106 booking records through /v2/consignments before the token was revoked.</p><div><p class=\"product_sectionLabel__iRUDV\">Evidence</p><dl class=\"product_kv__qZr9Y\"><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Principal</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">d.okafor@northwind-logistics.example</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Source address</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">45.147.231.86</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Source ASN</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">AS9009 — M247 Europe SRL</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Prior sign-in</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">10.42.26.144 · 14:20:36 UTC</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Session token</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">eyJhbGci…a3f1c9e4b2</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Records touched</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">1,106 of 48,312</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Detection latency</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS \">91 s from first anomalous call</dd></div></dl></div><div class=\"product_step2__X16s2\"><p class=\"product_sectionLabel__iRUDV\">Triage notes</p><ol class=\"product_notes__lyeOr\"><li class=\"product_note__lrnYE\" style=\"--enter-delay:0ms\"><span class=\"product_noteMeta__tbFlh\"><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">14:22:41<!-- --> UTC</span><span class=\"product_noteAnalyst__ixJaY\">K. Osei</span></span><p class=\"product_noteBody__esLIG\">Confirmed the 14:20:36 sign-in is genuine — device NWL-LT-4417, compliant, MFA satisfied. The 14:22:07 session reuses the same refresh token from a hosting ASN. Token theft, not a shared account.</p></li><li class=\"product_note__lrnYE\" style=\"--enter-delay:60ms\"><span class=\"product_noteMeta__tbFlh\"><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">14:24:09<!-- --> UTC</span><span class=\"product_noteAnalyst__ixJaY\">M. Thorne</span></span><p class=\"product_noteBody__esLIG\">Pulled the browser credential store timeline on NWL-LT-4417. ENX-88209 fired on the same host at 14:03:58 for T1555.003. That is the acquisition step. Treating as one chain, not two alerts.</p></li><li class=\"product_note__lrnYE\" style=\"--enter-delay:120ms\"><span class=\"product_noteMeta__tbFlh\"><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">14:26:55<!-- --> UTC</span><span class=\"product_noteAnalyst__ixJaY\">M. Thorne</span></span><p class=\"product_noteBody__esLIG\">Revoked all refresh tokens for the principal, forced re-enrolment, isolated NWL-LT-4417. Client security lead (R. Venkatesan) acknowledged on the bridge at 14:26:12.</p></li></ol></div><div class=\"product_step3___C_Q0\"><div class=\"product_verdict__bReey\"><span class=\"product_verdictHead__uYXXj\"><span class=\"product_verdictLabel__rB0nq\">Analyst conclusion</span><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">14:29:33<!-- --> UTC</span><span class=\"product_noteAnalyst__ixJaY\">M. Thorne</span><span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m\">Incident <span class=\"u-mono\">INC-2026-0417</span></span></span><p class=\"product_panelProse__xSnHp\"><strong class=\"product_strong__md3es\">True positive — confirmed credential theft and replay. No data exfiltration observed.</strong></p><p class=\"product_panelProse__xSnHp\">Tokens revoked, host isolated, egress to AS9009 blocked at the edge. 1,106 accessed records enumerated for the client’s notification assessment; booking payloads are not special-category data.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"product_statusbar__oc8me\"><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\"><span class=\"product_statusStrong__YKQ3R\">9</span> open</span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Log sources<!-- --> <span class=\"product_statusStrong__YKQ3R u-mono u-tnum\">312<!-- -->/<!-- -->317</span> <!-- -->healthy</span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\"><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">4.18 bn</span> events/day</span><span class=\"product_statusSpacer__zs5xg\"></span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Incident <span class=\"u-mono\">INC-2026-0417</span> · commander<!-- --> <span class=\"product_statusStrong__YKQ3R\">M. Thorne</span></span></div></div><figcaption class=\"product_caption__f0O7Y\">Representative view of the managed SIEM console of the kind this client&#x27;s analysts work in. Illustrative data — not this client&#x27;s estate.</figcaption></figure></div></div><div class=\"cs-console\"><div class=\"cs-console__say\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">The service level, reported honestly</p><h3 class=\"cs-console__title\">Four minutes against a fifteen-minute commitment</h3><p class=\"cs-console__body\">Time to human contact rather than time to forwarding, with the months that missed still on the page. A report with no misses on it over a year is a report nobody is reading.</p></div><div class=\"cs-console__art\"><figure data-reveal=\"\" class=\"product_figure__CFsTQ\"><div class=\"product_console__JtIC_\"><div class=\"product_titlebar__rns9g\"><span class=\"product_titleGroup__MMGDe\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check product_titleIcon__O6a8i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"product_title__jwaL7\">Service level — Monthly report</span><span class=\"product_tenant__pmMjS\">Northwind Logistics Group<!-- --> · <span class=\"u-mono\">TEN-4471</span></span></span><span class=\"product_titleSpacer__Z