on__f0O7Y\">Representative view of the monthly service-level report issued on a retainer of this shape. Illustrative data — not this client&#x27;s estate.</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"cs-timeline\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"cs-band\"><div class=\"cs-band__head\"><h2 id=\"cs-timeline\" class=\"cs-band__title\">The engagement in time</h2><p class=\"cs-band__hint\">7 weeks to live, retainer ongoing · Retainer</p></div><figure class=\"eb\"><svg class=\"eb-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 146\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Engagement timeline for this study, 8 weeks end to end. Architecture, 2 weeks. telemetry validation, 2 weeks. detection build, 2 weeks. runbook at 6 weeks. live at 7 weeks. purple team at 8 weeks.\"><g><rect class=\"eb-seg\" x=\"0\" y=\"74\" width=\"250\" height=\"26\"></rect><text class=\"eb-segLabel\" x=\"8\" y=\"91\">Architecture</text></g><g><rect class=\"eb-seg eb-seg--alt\" x=\"250\" y=\"74\" width=\"250\" height=\"26\"></rect><text class=\"eb-segLabel\" x=\"258\" y=\"91\">telemetry validation</text></g><g><rect class=\"eb-seg\" x=\"500\" y=\"74\" width=\"250\" height=\"26\"></rect><text class=\"eb-segLabel\" x=\"508\" y=\"91\">detection build</text></g><g><line class=\"eb-markLine\" x1=\"750\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"750\" y2=\"100\"></line><circle class=\"eb-markDot\" cx=\"750\" cy=\"100\" r=\"3.5\"></circle><text class=\"eb-markLabel\" x=\"756\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"start\">runbook</text></g><g><line class=\"eb-markLine\" x1=\"875\" y1=\"44\" x2=\"875\" y2=\"100\"></line><circle class=\"eb-markDot\" cx=\"875\" cy=\"100\" r=\"3.5\"></circle><text class=\"eb-markLabel\" x=\"869\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"end\">live</text></g><g><line class=\"eb-markLine\" x1=\"999\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"999\" y2=\"100\"></line><circle class=\"eb-markDot\" cx=\"999\" cy=\"100\" r=\"3.5\"></circle><text class=\"eb-markLabel\" x=\"993\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"end\">purple team</text></g><line class=\"eb-axis\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"1000\" y2=\"112\"></line><text class=\"eb-axisLabel\" x=\"0\" y=\"128\">week 0</text><text class=\"eb-axisLabel\" x=\"1000\" y=\"128\" text-anchor=\"end\">week 8</text></svg><ol class=\"eb-list\"><li class=\"eb-item\" data-kind=\"span\"><span class=\"eb-itemName\">Architecture</span><span class=\"eb-itemWhen u-mono\">2 weeks</span></li><li class=\"eb-item\" data-kind=\"span\"><span class=\"eb-itemName\">telemetry validation</span><span class=\"eb-itemWhen u-mono\">2 weeks</span></li><li class=\"eb-item\" data-kind=\"span\"><span class=\"eb-itemName\">detection build</span><span class=\"eb-itemWhen u-mono\">2 weeks</span></li><li class=\"eb-item\" data-kind=\"mark\"><span class=\"eb-itemName\">runbook</span><span class=\"eb-itemWhen u-mono\">week 6</span></li><li class=\"eb-item\" data-kind=\"mark\"><span class=\"eb-itemName\">live</span><span class=\"eb-itemWhen u-mono\">week 7</span></li><li class=\"eb-item\" data-kind=\"mark\"><span class=\"eb-itemName\">purple team</span><span class=\"eb-itemWhen u-mono\">week 8</span></li></ol><figcaption class=\"eb-cap\">Segment length is this engagement’s own stated duration, converted to weeks and drawn to one scale. A stage stated as a date rather than a length — “month 11” — is drawn as a milestone on the same axis instead of being given a width it never had, and a stage with no stated end is listed below rather than drawn, because an open commitment has no length to draw.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"cs-engagement\"><div class=\"u-container\"><h2 id=\"cs-engagement\" class=\"u-eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--s8)\">The engagement</h2><ul class=\"cs-facts\"><li class=\"cs-fact\"><h3 class=\"cs-fact__key u-eyebrow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg>Tech and tools</h3><ul class=\"cs-fact__chips\" aria-label=\"Stack and tooling\"><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Microsoft Sentinel</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">CrowdStrike Falcon</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Entra ID</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Azure</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Sigma</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Terraform</span></li></ul></li><li class=\"cs-fact\"><h3 class=\"cs-fact__key u-eyebrow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg>Team shape</h3><p class=\"cs-fact__body\">A named service lead, a detection engineer, a cloud security reviewer, and the 24/7 analyst rota.</p></li><li class=\"cs-fact\"><h3 class=\"cs-fact__key u-eyebrow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg>Length and shape</h3><p class=\"cs-fact__body\">7 weeks to live, retainer ongoing · Retainer · 5 phases</p></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"cs-related\"><div class=\"u-container\"><h2 id=\"cs-related\" style=\"font-size:var(--text-2xl);margin-bottom:var(--s8)\">Related case studies</h2><ul class=\"reveal-group cs-related\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg cs-card\"><div class=\"cs-card__top\"><p class=\"cs-card__client\">B2B SaaS platform, 140 employees</p><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--brand\">Under NDA</span></div><h3 class=\"cs-card__headline\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/case-studies/saas-cloud-identity-review\">Three weeks of identity-graph analysis found a four-step path from any repository contributor to the customer database.</a></h3><p class=\"cs-card__meta\"><span>SaaS &amp; Technology</span><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3.230769230769231\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Germany</span><span>Project</span></p><ul class=\"cs-card__tags\" aria-label=\"Services used on B2B SaaS platform, 140 employees\"><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Cloud Security</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Platform &amp; DevOps</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">GRC &amp; Compliance</span></li></ul><div class=\"cs-card__metric\"><p class=\"cs-card__metric-value u-tnum\">4 steps</p><p class=\"cs-card__metric-label\">from repository contributor to customer data</p></div></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg cs-card\"><div class=\"cs-card__top\"><p class=\"cs-card__client\">Enterprise payments provider, 900 employees</p><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--brand\">Under NDA</span></div><h3 class=\"cs-card__headline\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/case-studies/fintech-payment-platform\">A payment platform handling £4.1bn a year went from 23 repeat finding classes a year to four.</a></h3><p class=\"cs-card__meta\"><span>Financial Services</span><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3.230769230769231\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>United Kingdom</span><span>Retainer</span></p><ul class=\"cs-card__tags\" aria-label=\"Services used on Enterprise payments provider, 900 employees\"><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Penetration Testing</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">AppSec</span></li></ul><div class=\"cs-card__metric\"><p class=\"cs-card__metric-value u-tnum\">35 → 9</p><p class=\"cs-card__metric-label\">confirmed findings between first and fourth test</p></div></div></li></ul><p style=\"margin-top:var(--s8)\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/case-studies\">All case studies</a> · <a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/sample-report\">Walk a sample report</a></p></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\" aria-labelledby=\"cs-cta\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"humans\"><div><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">Get started</p><h2 id=\"cs-cta\" style=\"font-size:var(--text-3xl);margin:var(--s3) 0 0\">Book a 60-minute scoping call</h2><p style=\"color:var(--muted-strong);max-width:52ch;margin-top:var(--s4)\">A technical conversation with the person who would lead the work — not a qualification script, not a discovery deck. You come away with a written scope, the exclusions stated in the body rather than in an appendix, and a day count that we have not padded.</p><div class=\"humans__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span><span class=\"btn__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--lg\" href=\"/sample-report\"><span>Walk the report</span><span class=\"btn__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"btn btn--ghost btn--lg\" href=\"/customers\"><span><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:var(--s2)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Who we work with</span></span></a></div><p class=\"humans__sla\">A named engineer replies within one business day. Scoping call within three.</p></div><ul class=\"humans__people\" aria-label=\"Who replies to a new enquiry\"><li class=\"human\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder portrait for Claire Benoit\" class=\"avatar-ph\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;font-size:16px;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(153 18% 22%), hsl(153 22% 14%))\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">CB</span></div><div><p class=\"human__name\">Claire Benoit</p><p class=\"human__role\">Practice Director, Governance &amp; Risk</p></div></li><li class=\"human\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder portrait for Marcus Reid\" class=\"avatar-ph\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;font-size:16px;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(319 18% 22%), hsl(319 22% 14%))\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">MR</span></div><div><p class=\"human__name\">Marcus Reid</p><p class=\"human__role\">Head of Engineering</p></div></li><li class=\"human\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder portrait for Amara Nwosu\" class=\"avatar-ph\" style=\"width:48px;height:48px;font-size:16px;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(334 18% 22%), hsl(334 22% 14%))\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">AN</span></div><div><p class=\"human__name\">Amara Nwosu</p><p class=\"human__role\">Chief Operating Officer</p></div></li></ul></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"foot theme-dark transition-theme grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"foot__top\"><div class=\"foot__brand\"><a class=\"foot__wordmark\" href=\"/\">Envenox</a><p class=\"foot__positioning\">Envenox is a software development firm. We ship production systems — custom software, web applications, ERP and the platforms underneath them — and we keep an offensive security practice on staff that attacks what we build before anyone else gets the chance.</p><a class=\"foot__hotline\" href=\"tel:+442045259100\" data-ir-hotline=\"footer\"><span class=\"foot__hotline-row\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg><span class=\"u-eyebrow\">Incident response — 24/7</span></span><span class=\"foot__hotline-number\">+44 20 4525 9100</span><span class=\"foot__hotline-note\">Answered by a responder, 24/7. Median pickup under 4 minutes.</span></a></div><nav class=\"foot__cols\" aria-label=\"Footer\"><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Cybersecurity</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/application-security\">Application Security</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/cloud-security\">Cloud Security</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/red-teaming\">Red Teaming</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/incident-response\">Incident Response</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\">GRC &amp; Compliance</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/vciso\">vCISO</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Software Development</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/custom-software\">Custom Software</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/web-application-development\">Web Applications</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/platform-engineering\">Platform &amp; DevOps</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/erp\">ERP</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/crm\">CRM</a></li><li><a class=\