t: 500;\\n  color: var(--fg);\\n}\\n.human__role { margin: 0; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--muted); }\\n.humans__actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--s3); margin-top: var(--s6); }\\n.humans__sla { margin: var(--s4) 0 0; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--muted); max-width: 46ch; }\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"39:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-hero\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-hero__main\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-meta__markers\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-meta__nda\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"style\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"envenox-proof-surfaces\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"$5a\\\"}],\\\"$L5b\\\"]}],null]}],\\\"$L5c\\\"]}],\\\"$L5d\\\"]}]\\n3b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"prose u-measure\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"The client had a SIEM, a vendor rule pack, an alert queue nobody read, and a managed service whose contractual commitment was measured on how fast an alert was forwarded. That service level rewards forwarding, so that is what it produced: 60 to 90 notifications a week, each requiring the client’s two-person security team to perform the investigation. The team had rationally stopped reading them. An auditor had asked for detection coverage evidence and the honest answer was that nobody knew.\\\"}]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"3c:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-band\\\",\\\"style\\\":{\\\"marginTop\\\":\\\"var(--s24)\\\"},\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-band__head\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"u-eyebrow\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"In \\\",5,\\\" phases\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"id\\\":\\\"cs-approach\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-band__title\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The approach\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L51\\\",null,{\\\"as\\\":\\\"ol\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phases\\\",\\\"aria-labelledby\\\":\\\"cs-approach\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3f\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"as\\\":\\\"li\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase__n u-mono u-tnum\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"01\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase__name\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Architecture before alerts\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase__body\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Two weeks on the architecture, the identity model and the crown jewels — the customs declaration system and the payment run. We wrote down what an attack on this specific business would look like before writing a detection.\\\"}]]}]]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3f\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"as\\\":\\\"li\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase__n u-mono u-tnum\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"02\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase__name\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Validate every log source\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase__body\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Each configured source was checked for actual delivery, not configured status. Twenty-two of seventy-one had never delivered an event. Four more had stopped in 2024 after a platform upgrade. This is the single most common gap we find and it is invisible until someone looks.\\\"}]]}]]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3f\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"as\\\":\\\"li\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase__n u-mono u-tnum\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"03\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase__name\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Write detections against the real architecture\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase__body\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Sigma rules in the client’s own repository, reviewed as code, mapped to ATT\\u0026CK. The vendor pack was retired rather than tuned, because a pack with its noisy rules disabled is a pack with its coverage disabled.\\\"}]]}]]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3f\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"as\\\":\\\"li\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase__n u-mono u-tnum\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"04\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase__name\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Agree containment authority while nobody was under pressure\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase__body\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Host isolation and session revocation pre-authorised after a confirmed detection; anything touching customs declaration availability requires a phone call. Written down in week six, reviewed quarterly.\\\"}]]}]]}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3f\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"as\\\":\\\"li\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase__n u-mono u-tnum\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"05\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase__name\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Validate with real technique execution\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"cs-phase__body\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"A purple-team exercise in week eight executed 34 techniques against the live telemetry. Twenty-six produced a detectable signal. The eight that did not were fixed, and the exercise is now quarterly.\\\"}]]}]]}]}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"3e:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"prose u-measure\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":\\\"The gap that mattered most was identity, not endpoint. The previous service monitored EDR telemetry and firewall logs and did not ingest the identity provider’s sign-in logs at all, which means a session-token replay from a stolen browser cookie — no password, no MFA prompt, no endpoint agent involvement — produced no signal anywhere in the estate. The purple team demonstrated exactly this: a token exported from a test workstation was replayed from a different country and a different device, accessed the customs declaration system, and generated zero alerts under the old configuration. Impossible-travel and unfamiliar-device detections now cover it, and the client was able to show an auditor the before and after with the technique execution as evidence. A second finding during cloud review: the CI role could assume the production deployment role, which could read the KMS key that decrypts the declaration archive — a three-step path from a repository contributor to the data.\\\"}]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"40:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"product_chipRow__xIuJh\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"svg\\\",null,{\\\"ref\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"xmlns\\\":\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\",\\\"width\\\":11,\\\"height\\\":11,\\\"viewBox\\\":\\\"0 0 24 24\\\",\\\"fill\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"stroke\\\":\\\"currentColor\\\",\\\"strokeWidth\\\":2,\\\"strokeLinecap\\\":\\\"round\\\",\\\"strokeLinejoin\\\":\\\"round\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"lucide lucide-funnel product_titleIcon__O6a8i\\\",\\\"aria-hidden\\\":\\\"true\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"path\\\",\\\"sc7q7i\\\",{\\\"d\\\":\\\"M10 20a1 1 0 0 0 .553.895l2 1A1 1 0 0 0 14 21v-7a2 2 0 